<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 6.6</h2>
<h3 class="hl">Highlights</h3>
<ul class="highlights">
<li><strong>Open Claude Code sessions in VS Code.</strong> Right-click a Claude Code session to open its local folder and resume in the verified VS Code or Insiders window. Install the Claude Code extension and trust the project folder. Resuming a removed worktree from its repository root requires Claude Code extension 2.1.300 or later. Contributed by @dobernhardt in #91.</li>
<li><strong>Resume supported CLI sessions in Macterm.</strong> Select Macterm under Settings → General → Terminal App. Resume reuses the nearest local project and opens a new tab in the session folder. Contributed by @kian1991 in #94.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Updated model pricing.</strong> Session cost estimates and Quota Meter now use GPT-6.2 pricing and refreshed rates for other models.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/releases/tag/v6.6">https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/releases/tag/v6.6</a></p>
